  "analysisNotes": [
    "Fallback graph was rebuilt manually from current package.xml files, sentry_all.launch.py, gimbal_driver_config.yaml, SerialMode raw-topic mapping, Topic.hpp, behavior_tree source, gimbal_driver source, navi_tf_bridge source, simulator source, and current docs because no usable Understand Anything plugin core is installed.",
    "Only six ROS packages currently exist under src/*/package.xml: auto_aim_common, behavior_tree, gimbal_driver, navi_tf_bridge, simulator, and tf_tree.",
    "PreRoadland and Roadland are formal same-level MainAreaKinds. MyPreRoadland owns BaseGoalId 25 and ends after its configured arrival hold; Roadland keeps its name, uses the former ReadyRoadLand boundary, and retains the ID 21/22 guarded crossing. UnitInfo area IDs 8/9 represent my/enemy PreRoadland without changing existing IDs 0-7.",
    "Internal detector, tracker_solver, predictor, buff_hitter, outpost_hitter, shooting_table_calib, and buff_shooting_table_calib are removed; they have no graph layer, node, edge, launch role, or formal topic contract.",
    "The graph is package/topic/file level, not a complete AST call graph.",
    "navigation_mode is owned only by debug_mode.yaml and loaded through gimbal_driver/debug_node.launch.py for standalone direct debugging. gimbal_driver consumes /ly/navi/vel and /ly/navi/should_rotate directly; the legacy navi_vel_chain bridge is removed. Formal sentry_all does not pass base_config_file or config_file to gimbal_driver; the formal chain remains external navigation -> behavior_tree -> /ly/control/* -> gimbal_driver.",
    "2026-07-16 source audit repaired structured aim feedback, complete SentryCmd, FaceMode solver, BT position downlink, navigation feedback, and tf_tree fallback relations; launch/runtime graph validation is still pending."
